  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\n**Logic: Second number = First number³ - First number².**\n\n**17:**** 4624** → 17³ - 17² = 4913 - 289 = 4624\n\n**13:**** 2028** → 13³ - 13² = 2197 - 169 = 2028\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) 4 : 180 → 4³ - 4² = 64 - 16 = 48\n\n2) 7 : 180 → 7³ - 7² = 343 - 49 = 294\n\n**3) 6 : 180 → 6³ - 6² = 216 - 36 = 180**\n\n4) 11 : 180 → 11³ - 11² = 1331 - 121 = 1210\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"6\".**",
